              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "theoretisch — \"in theory, theoretical\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Theoretisch kann man die Strecke in zwei Stunden fahren. In theory you can drive the route in two hours."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Theoretisch …, praktisch … — in theory …, in practice …"
            }
          ]
        },
