          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "unter Umständen — \"under certain circumstances, possibly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Unter Umständen dauert die Reparatur eine Woche. Under certain circumstances the repair may take a week."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Written short as u. U. Der Umstand — the circumstance; Umstände machen — to cause trouble."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Umstand joins um \"around\" to Stand \"standing, position\" (EtymDB). It is usually explained as a rendering of Latin circumstantia \"a standing around\", from circumstāre \"to stand around\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
